ns\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.dev5.official [64b09905c], v4.5.dev4.official [209a446], v4.5.dev3.official [28089c4]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev5 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7283) - AMD Ryzen 7 6800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAdding outlines to a part of the text using BBCode in a RichTextLabel does not work.\nThe outline will be displayed on the left of the label, instead of around the part of the text where the BBCode tag has been inserted.\n\nExpected: (v4.4.1)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/965cfb16-2c3d-45cc-afce-43f5bcbf3b22)\n\nCurrent: (v4.5dev5):\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7bcb73e-d8ee-47e1-8945-675e2c7bc884)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new scene\n- Add a RichTextLabel node\n- Set \"BBCode Enabled\" to true\n- Set the text to \"This text has an [outline_size=5]OUTLINE[/outline_size].\"\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_-_rich_text_label_outline.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20575570/mrp_-_rich_text_label_outline.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos"